  "description": "A lightweight C# utility library providing common helper methods, extension methods, enums, constants, and a standardised Result pattern for handling operation outcomes (success, failure, messages, and errors). Designed to reduce boilerplate and improve consistency across .NET applications and Azure services. Ideal for shared use across APIs, Functions, and microservices.",
