  "releaseNotes": "1. Made OperationResult properties internal to prevent incorrect usage.\n2. Enforced creation and mutation via extension methods only.\n3. Added fluent static extension methods for direct usage without instantiating objects, e.g.: OperationResult.WithSuccess(\"Operation completed successfully\");",
